    description: "Build-target linker currently connects Cargo [[bin]] and npm bin to main(). The same pattern applies to 13+ other languages with build manifest entry points: Python (pyproject.toml scripts), Java/Kotlin (Maven/Gradle mainClass), C# (.csproj StartupObject), Dart (pubspec.yaml executables), Swift (Package.swift executableTarget), Haskell (.cabal main-is), Elixir (mix.exs escript), Ruby (gemspec executables), Scala (build.sbt mainClass), OCaml (dune executable), Zig (build.zig addExecutable), Nim (.nimble bin). See WI-simak discussion for full analysis."  # 8732
